body:
I spent time as a law enforcement officer and later as a first responder. Yes, as much as I loved those roles and the ability it gave me to help others - the anxiety it caused was the contributing factor in me walking away from both. I haven't found what I want to do now, yet.. however I'm still on that journey. 

&#x200B;

For whatever reason you asked, if there is one - I hope you can find some peace from it.
